{"id":"memorial_101902","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101900","label":"Call Logs · Audio Portion of a Streamer's Live Stream"},"label":"BJ_02.mp4","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101901","next":"memorial_101903","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101902_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"(The file is corrupted, and only the audio can be played.)"},{"id":"memorial_101902_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"Big news, everyone! I was out searching for food outside just now,"},{"id":"memorial_101902_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"and I ran into some aliens! They were total pushovers, though."},{"id":"memorial_101902_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"When they were rushing at me,"},{"id":"memorial_101902_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"all I had to do was bonk them on the head with a piece of plywood..."},{"id":"memorial_101902_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"and BAM! They practically disintegrated."},{"id":"memorial_101902_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"Huh? You don't believe me?"},{"id":"memorial_101902_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"Fine, I'll live stream tomorrow and prove it."},{"id":"memorial_101902_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"SurvivorMan says he'll donate $800 if I send another alien packing. It's a deal!"},{"id":"memorial_101902_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"I took a screenshot, so no takebacks!"},{"id":"memorial_101902_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"Guys, remember to watch tomorrow's stream."},{"id":"memorial_101902_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"It'll be at 10:00 PM, so don't miss it."},{"id":"memorial_101902_13","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_02_description","text":"Come and watch me use these aliens for batting practice!"}]}